BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:In Conversation | Rebecca Baird and Kenny Baird with Lisa Deanne S
 mith
DTSTART;TZID=America/Toronto:20261024T130000
DTEND;TZID=America/Toronto:20261024T150000
UID:conversation-rebecca-baird-and-kenny-baird-lisa-deanne-smith@ocadu.ca
DESCRIPTION:Join us for an engaging conversation and exhibition tour with 
 artists Rebecca Baird and Kenny Alvin Baird\, alongside exhibition curator
  Lisa Deanne Smith\, as they explore the stories\, creative processes\, an
 d lived experiences behind Returning to Ourselves.\n\nIn Conversation | Re
 becca Baird and Kenny Baird with Lisa Deanne Smith – Saturday\, October 
 24\, 2026\, 1:00 p.m. to 3:00 p.m.\, Onsite Gallery\, 199 Richmond Street 
 West\, Toronto Join us for an engaging conversation and exhibition tour wi
 th artists Rebecca Baird and Kenny Alvin Baird \, alongside exhibition cur
 ator Lisa Deanne Smith \, as they explore the stories\, creative processes
 \, and lived experiences behind Returning to Ourselves . Spanning more tha
 n four decades of artistic practice\, Returning to Ourselves showcases the
  transformative work of Rebecca and Kenny Alvin Baird through sculpture\, 
 painting\, traditional material practices\, interior design\, film art dir
 ection\, graphic design\, and public art commissions. Together\, the artis
 ts and curator will reflect on the exhibition's themes of identity\, famil
 y\, creativity\, and Cree Métis cultural continuity\, offering unique ins
 ights into the evolution of their multidisciplinary practices and the endu
 ring impact of their work. Visit Registration Page Image banner credit: Re
 becca Baird and Kenny Alvin Baird \, 1991. Image courtesy of the artists.
LOCATION:Onsite Gallery (RHD) 199 Richmond Street West 199 Richmond Street
  West
URL:https://www.ocadu.ca/events-and-exhibitions/conversation-rebecca-baird
 -and-kenny-baird-lisa-deanne-smith
X-SOURCE:OCAD University
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:Beaded Rosette Workshop with Rebecca Baird
DTSTART;TZID=America/Toronto:20261016T120000
DTEND;TZID=America/Toronto:20261016T150000
UID:beaded-rosette-workshop-rebecca-baird@ocadu.ca
DESCRIPTION:Beaded Rosette Workshop with Rebecca Baird\n\nBeaded Rosette W
 orkshop with Rebecca Baird Friday\, October 16\, 2026\, 12:00 p.m. to 3:00
  p.m. Onsite Gallery\, 199 Richmond Street West\, Toronto Discover the art
 istry and tradition of beadwork in this immersive Beaded Rosette Workshop 
 led by exhibition artist Rebecca Baird . In this hands-on\, three-hour wor
 kshop\, participants will explore the creative process of designing and cr
 afting their own unique beaded rosette while learning foundational beadwor
 k techniques in a welcoming and supportive environment. Guided step by ste
 p by Rebecca\, participants will gain an introduction to traditional beadi
 ng methods\, including pattern development\, stitching techniques\, and fi
 nishing practices. With personalized instruction throughout the session\, 
 you'll have the opportunity to work at your own pace\, ask questions\, and
  develop the skills needed to create a beautifully detailed piece. All mat
 erials are included\, with each participant receiving three beading needle
 s\, a piece of black cloth\, and a carefully selected assortment of beads 
 to complete their rosette. Whether you're new to beadwork or looking to de
 epen your existing practice\, this workshop offers a meaningful opportunit
 y to connect with the creative process while developing a timeless handcra
 ft. By the end of the workshop\, you'll leave with a one-of-a-kind handcra
 fted beaded rosette\, a deeper appreciation for the art of beadwork\, and 
 the confidence to continue exploring this rewarding creative practice. Spa
 ce is limited. Please email to register to susanjama@ocadu.ca
LOCATION:Onsite Gallery (RHD) 199 Richmond Street West 199 Richmond Street
  West
URL:https://www.ocadu.ca/events-and-exhibitions/beaded-rosette-workshop-re
 becca-baird
X-SOURCE:OCAD University
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:OCAD University Senate Meeting
DTSTART;TZID=America/Toronto:20260928T151500
DTEND;TZID=America/Toronto:20260928T181500
UID:ocad-university-senate-meeting-19@ocadu.ca
DESCRIPTION:OCAD University Senate Meeting\n\nThe next regular meeting of 
 the OCAD University Senate is scheduled to take place on Monday\, Septembe
 r 28\, 2026 from 3:15 pm – 6:15 pm EDT. The Senate is responsible for th
 e establishment and regulation of academic policy\, standards and procedur
 es at OCAD University. The Senate and its many committees are in charge of
  all matters pertaining to OCAD U academic resources\, academic programmin
 g\, academic strategic planning\, student affairs and any other such matte
 rs relating to academic issues. More information can be found on the OCAD 
 U Senate webpage . If you would like to attend as a guest\, or if you have
  any questions\, please contact David Wagschal\, Quality Assurance Officer
  & Associate Senate Secretary at dwagschal@ocadu.ca.
URL:https://www.ocadu.ca/events-and-exhibitions/ocad-university-senate-mee
 ting-19
X-SOURCE:OCAD University
END:VEVENT
